abstract: >-
  Harness and analysis code, study materials (tasks, fixtures, mechanism catalogue), per-program outcome tables, secondary analyses,
  harm coding and the hash table of the generated programs of a pre-registered study of silent result drift of LLM-generated pandas
  programs under pandas 3.
